      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Nothing beats the thrill of taking something that belongs to someone else, especially if you can do so completely unnoticed. You might be a pickpocket working the streets, a cat burglar sneaking through windows, or even a consultant, testing clients’ vaults for openings.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
